OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with occasionally heavy
OL,6,Frain spreading north in the morning.
OL,7,FStaying cloudy in the afternoon with
OL,8,Ffurther showery rain, occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy with a chance of thunder.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with scattered showers
OL,12,Fat first, heavy at times, but these
OL,13,Fgradually fading out through the
OL,14,Fevening. Dry spells and the odd light
OL,15,Fshower overnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FCloudy with dry spells and
OL,18,Fa few light showers at first.
OL,19,FScattered showers or longer spells of
OL,20,Frain in the afternoon, heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
